"B<int pthread_atfork(void (*>I<prepare>B<)(void), void (*>I<parent>B<)(void),>\n"
"B<                   void (*>I<child>B<)(void));>\n"
msgstr ""
"B<int pthread_atfork(void (*>I<prepare>B<)(void), void (*>I<parent>B<)(void),>\n"
"B<                   void (*>I<child>B<)(void));>\n"

